Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:04:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] ram: sunxi: enable V851 MBUS masters
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CatPlay V851S board port]

Enable all V851 MBUS masters in the common D1/V851 SPL DRAM setup. The
0xffff MAER1 mask includes V851 CE master 40 at MAER1 bit 8.
---
 drivers/ram/sunxi/dram_sun20i_d1.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/ram/sunxi/dram_sun20i_d1.c b/drivers/ram/sunxi/dram_sun20i_d1.c
index befc69fbb4..abbc3bc462 100644
--- a/drivers/ram/sunxi/dram_sun20i_d1.c
+++ b/drivers/ram/sunxi/dram_sun20i_d1.c
@@ -105,7 +105,7 @@ static void dram_enable_all_master(void)
 			(struct sunxi_mctl_com_reg *)SUNXI_DRAM_COM_BASE;
 	
 	writel(~0, &mctl_com->maer0);
-	writel(0xff, &mctl_com->maer1);
+	writel(0xffff, &mctl_com->maer1);
 	writel(0xffff, &mctl_com->maer2);
 	udelay(10);
 }
